 "notes": "Layer 0 constructs exact ramp/step features for the x and y regions, passenger indicators, D=[fuel>=x+y+4], and H=[fuel>=x-y+12]. Layer 1 combines these into mutually exclusive action rules. With a passenger, the policy DROPs at (0,0), follows a feasible direct route when D holds, and otherwise heads toward the gas station. Without a passenger, it PICKs_UP only when sufficient fuel remains, otherwise heading toward pickup or gas. From the initial state it follows gas -> pickup -> gas -> drop twice. Fuel is reset at the station, passenger-on-board fuel never falls below 4, and jobs_done=2 is reached deterministically. Action-rule logits are 4; the x=0 fallback logit is 1.",
